{% render 'async-stylesheet', file: 'science-cellular.css' %}
<section class="cellular-level">
    <div class="cellular-level__image">
        <picture>
            <source srcset="{{ 'cellular-level-bg.avif' | file_url }}" type="image/avif">
            <img src="{{ 'cellular-level-bg.webp' |  file_url }}" alt="WHAT HAPPENS AT THE CELLULAR LEVEL"
                fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="container">

        <div class="cellular-level__inner">

            <div class="cellular-level__content">

                <div class="cellular-level__label gray-badge">
                    WHAT HAPPENS AT THE CELLULAR LEVEL
                </div>

                <h2 class="cellular-level__title">
                    <span>Cells read inputs continuously.</span>
                    Quality of signal determines <br> quality of response.
                </h2>

                <div class="cellular-level__text">
                    <p>
                        Fragmented, low-quality inputs force the body into defense mode.
                        Energy diverts toward maintenance. Repair slows. Cognitive output
                        drops. The body spends resources fighting noise instead of building
                        function.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            Api-Complex delivers inputs in the arrangement the body already
                            trusts: bioavailable nutrients, clear signals, reduced
                            interference. The response compounds over time.
                        </strong>
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="cellular-level__grid">

                <article class="cellular-level-card">
                    <div class="cellular-level-card__header">
                        <div class="cellular-level-card__icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                                <path
                                    d="M6.34582 9.95185L11.9996 4.29785L17.6533 9.95185L16.5688 11.0056L12.7496 7.18635L12.7496 19.7019L11.2496 19.7019L11.2496 7.18635L7.43032 11.0056L6.34582 9.95185Z"
                                    fill="currentColor" />
                            </svg>

                        </div>
                        <h3 class="cellular-level-card__title">
                            Mitochondrial Output
                        </h3>
                    </div>




                    <p class="cellular-level-card__text">
                        Stable energy production <br> as nutrient availability improves <br class="mobile-br">
                        <br> and
                        metabolic noise drops.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="cellular-level-card">
                    <div class="cellular-level-card__header">
                        <div class="cellular-level-card__icon negative">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                                <path
                                    d="M6.34582 9.95185L11.9996 4.29785L17.6533 9.95185L16.5688 11.0056L12.7496 7.18635L12.7496 19.7019L11.2496 19.7019L11.2496 7.18635L7.43032 11.0056L6.34582 9.95185Z"
                                    fill="currentColor" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="cellular-level-card__title">
                            Stress Response Load
                        </h3>
                    </div>


                    <p class="cellular-level-card__text">
                        Propolis reduces chronic inflammatory burden.<br class="mobile-br"> <br> The body stops
                        bracing against constant low-level threat.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="cellular-level-card">
                    <div class="cellular-level-card__header">
                        <div class="cellular-level-card__icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                                <path
                                    d="M6.34582 9.95185L11.9996 4.29785L17.6533 9.95185L16.5688 11.0056L12.7496 7.18635L12.7496 19.7019L11.2496 19.7019L11.2496 7.18635L7.43032 11.0056L6.34582 9.95185Z"
                                    fill="currentColor" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="cellular-level-card__title">
                            Repair Pathways
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <p class="cellular-level-card__text">
                        Royal Jelly signals cellular regeneration. <br class="mobile-br"> Recovery accelerates
                        after effort, stress, and exposure.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="cellular-level-card">
                    <div class="cellular-level-card__header">
                        <div class="cellular-level-card__icon">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                                <path
                                    d="M6.34582 9.95185L11.9996 4.29785L17.6533 9.95185L16.5688 11.0056L12.7496 7.18635L12.7496 19.7019L11.2496 19.7019L11.2496 7.18635L7.43032 11.0056L6.34582 9.95185Z"
                                    fill="currentColor" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>

                        <h3 class="cellular-level-card__title">
                            Cognitive Clarity
                        </h3>
                    </div>


                    <p class="cellular-level-card__text">
                        10-HDA supports neurotransmitter function and neurogenesis.
                        <br>
                        Mental fog decreases as neural signal sharpens.
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>


